<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Magnates</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as magnate</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Magnates were the great noble landowners of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polish-lithuanian-commonwealth">Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth</a>, whose vast estates gave them enormous wealth and influence. Many maintained private armies and pursued their own political and military interests. Their power often overshadowed that of the king and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sejm">Sejm</a>, contributing to the Commonwealth's political weakness.</p></div>
